pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$primary"
elements:
  - elementId: hl-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 40, 700, 40]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>技术亮点与工程实践</p>

  - elementId: hl-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 88, 1160, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: hl-card1-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 110, 560, 240]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$card_bg"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: hl-card1-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 110, 4, 240]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}

  - elementId: hl-card1-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [85, 130, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:database"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}

  - elementId: hl-card1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [130, 128, 470, 32]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>本地向量搜索</p>

  - elementId: hl-card1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [85, 175, 510, 160]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$text_secondary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.7
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>无需外部向量数据库，纯本地实现</p>
        <p>DashScope text-embedding-v2 生成 1536 维向量</p>
        <p>numpy 批量余弦相似度计算，毫秒级响应</p>
        <p>TF-IDF 降级策略，确保服务离线可用</p>

  - elementId: hl-card2-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [660, 110, 560, 240]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$card_bg"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: hl-card2-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [660, 110, 4, 240]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent_blue"}

  - elementId: hl-card2-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [685, 130, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:gears"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent_blue"}

  - elementId: hl-card2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [730, 128, 470, 32]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>多 Agent 异步架构</p>

  - elementId: hl-card2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [685, 175, 510, 160]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$text_secondary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.7
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>转录 / 知识图谱 / 测验 / 向量索引并行处理</p>
        <p>状态机驱动进度追踪，前端实时轮询</p>
        <p>每会话独立任务队列，互不阻塞</p>
        <p>支持任务中断与重试机制</p>

  - elementId: hl-card3-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 375, 560, 240]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$card_bg"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: hl-card3-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 375, 4, 240]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent_green"}

  - elementId: hl-card3-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [85, 395, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:shield-halved"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent_green"}

  - elementId: hl-card3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [130, 393, 470, 32]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>三级容错降级</p>

  - elementId: hl-card3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [85, 440, 510, 160]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$text_secondary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.7
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>ASR：FunASR → DashScope → Whisper API</p>
        <p>Embedding：DashScope → TF-IDF 本地降级</p>
        <p>LLM：DeepSeek 主通道 + 错误兜底提示</p>
        <p>确保任何外部服务故障时核心功能可用</p>

  - elementId: hl-card4-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [660, 375, 560, 240]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$card_bg"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}

  - elementId: hl-card4-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [660, 375, 4, 240]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$text_secondary"}

  - elementId: hl-card4-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [685, 395, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:user-shield"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$text_secondary"}

  - elementId: hl-card4-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [730, 393, 470, 32]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>完整用户系统</p>

  - elementId: hl-card4-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [685, 440, 510, 160]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$text_secondary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.7
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>JWT 认证 + 密码哈希存储</p>
        <p>用户级数据隔离，权限精确控制</p>
        <p>分享链接生成，支持公开只读访问</p>
        <p>数据导入导出（.notero 格式）</p>

  - elementId: hl-pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1180, 680, 40, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>13</p>
